The llama.cpp integration lives out of tree (a gitlink here, without a
.gitmodules entry, broke every CI workflow at checkout: "No url found for
submodule path 'external/llama.cpp'").

Tested revision for the gpu-vector work on this branch:
  repo:   https://github.com/lukemartinlogan/llama.cpp
  branch: clio-vector-integration
  commit: dd00565e6  (clang-clean bridge, RESIDENT mode, stored-size publish)

Clone it here to build with CLIO_CORE_ENABLE_LLAMA_SERVER=ON.
